      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EAGLEYE (7) was out of the money two back at Kilmore. Turned in a better run last time out when third over 1690m at Shepparton, beaten 4 metres. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line but may need luck at some point. Meets a similar line up and she can figure in the finish. FLEUR BELLA (3) settled handy then assumed control and went on with the job to score in a 1790m race at this track last start, arriving 5.5 metres ahead of her rivals to make it two wins from her past four outings. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a similar line up so she is capable of getting the job done again. THE AFRICAN QUEEN (6) disappointed last time when seventh over 2190m at this track. Can atone. SUNSHINE WARRIOR (5) is worth another chance after a last-start eighth over 1790m at this track two weeks ago.",
